WEBVTT

00:01:27.875 --> 00:01:32.588
a system of government
with laws and a constitution,

00:01:32.588 --> 00:01:38.553
and a research display
demonstrating their knowledge of planets.

00:01:39.595 --> 00:01:40.930
That's a lot.

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:41.973
(Laughter)

00:01:42.014 --> 00:01:44.809
But these students aren't fazed,
they'd been here before.

00:01:45.351 --> 00:01:48.229
What they're interested in
is what group they'll be in

00:01:48.229 --> 00:01:49.981
and what roles they will play.

00:01:50.606 --> 00:01:52.483
Now I don't know about you,

00:01:52.483 --> 00:01:55.778
but when I was in fifth grade,
I wasn't doing that.

00:01:55.778 --> 00:01:56.821
(Laughter)

00:01:56.821 --> 00:01:58.573
But for many of these students,

00:01:58.614 --> 00:02:01.909
they have been learning like this
since kindergarten.